<content>1 Wiki Creation API

This page no longer creates wikis. The legacy Wiki Manager plugin flow has been retired.

Use the wiki creation API instead:

{code}
POST /api/v1/wikis/{WIKI_NAME}
{code}

The endpoint requires an authenticated superadmin user.

{code}
curl -X POST -u ${USERNAME}:${PASSWORD} https://main.${HOST}/api/v1/wikis/${WIKI_NAME}
{code}
